{"id":"viaje","lemma":"viaje","pos":"noun","rank":428,"glosses":["voyage","journey, trip","A state of hallucination or altered consciousness caused by a narcotic drug."],"ipa":"/biˈaxe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"viajes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-viaje.wav","formAudio":{"viajes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-viajes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Cómo estuvo tu viaje?","en":"How was your trip?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443707","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Espero que tengas un buen viaje.","en":"I hope you have a good trip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594821","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"¿Cómo estás? ¿Has tenido un buen viaje?","en":"How are you? Did you have a good trip?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1525","words":[null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"how are you?"]]},{"text":"Fue un viaje genial.","en":"It was a great trip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449020","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"great, very good"}]},{"text":"El viaje fue muy largo.","en":"The trip was really long.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/820367","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"long"}]}]}